# PLACEHOLDER art for the three cannabutter edibles.
#
# Drawn rather than derived (unlike space_cake.mctex, which retones vanilla's cake). All three
# share one idea so they read as a family: a warm baked base with hemp-green flecks through it,
# the same green ramp the Space Cake uses for its icing.
#
# Redraw freely. If you only want to retone, the green flecks are `g`/`G` in every palette.

@palette cookie
. = none
o = 2E1A08
d = 7A4E22
m = A9722F
h = E8B978
g = 486F2A
G = 2F4D1D

@texture item/space_cookie 16x16 palette=cookie type=item
