# Bhang is vanilla's milk_bucket with only the *milk* retoned -- the bucket metal is untouched, so
# it reads as the same object holding something else. Note vanilla shares FFFFFF between the milk
# surface and the specular highlight on the metal, so the milk's white needed its own character
# (`A`) or the bucket would have gone green too. Greens keep the milk tones' luminance ordering and
# sit slightly darker, which is right for a green drink.

@palette bhang
. = none
1 = 353535
2 = 727272
3 = 787878
4 = 969696
5 = 989898
6 = A8A8A8
7 = 8FA95E
8 = D8D8D8
9 = B5CE83
A = D6E6AE
a = FFFFFF

@texture item/bhang_bucket 16x16 palette=bhang type=item
................
.....111111.....
...1133555511...
..1379AAA99731..
..17AAAAAAAA71..
..111799AA7111..
..186111111241..
..188886642241..
..188a86642261..
..168a86642261..
..128a86642241..
...1888664241...
...1688644241...
....16864241....
.....111111.....
